.playwright-cli/
output/

# Untouched source media, kept on disk for re-encoding. 61MB — not worth
# versioning; the shipped assets in assets/ are derived from these.
assets/original/

# The Ghibli pack is a personal-use option (see its CREDITS.txt). This repo is
# public, so those stills must never be pushed — the pack lives only on the
# machines of people who add it themselves. The shipped pack is ukiyoe/.
assets/scenes/ghibli/

# Encoded background film loops (assets/loops/*.mp4, *.jpg, loops.local.js)
# were excluded here — third-party clips of unverifiable provenance in a
# public repo — until 2026-09-01, when the owner explicitly asked for them
# to be pushed anyway. Left unignored on purpose; do not silently restore
# this exclusion.
